## Supplier Management API

Base: `/api` (auth required)

### Entities

- Supplier: `name`, `address`, `phone`
- SupplierTransaction: `supplier_id`, `serial`, `total_amount`, `transaction_date`, `note`
- SupplierTransactionItem: `supplier_transaction_id`, `stock_item_id`, `quantity`, `purchase_price`

### Core Endpoints

#### Suppliers CRUD

- GET `/api/suppliers?q=ali&per_page=15` — list with `transactions_count` and contact info
- POST `/api/suppliers` — `{ "name": "Alpha Traders", "phone": "0300...", "address": "Market Rd" }`
- GET `/api/suppliers/{id}` — includes transactions and total spent
- PUT `/api/suppliers/{id}` — partial update
- DELETE `/api/suppliers/{id}` — blocked if transactions exist

#### Create Purchase (adds stock automatically)

POST `/api/suppliers/{supplierId}/purchases`
```json
{
  "serial": "INV-20251103-001", // optional; auto-generated if omitted
  "transaction_date": "2025-11-03",
  "note": "Monthly restock",
  "items": [
    // Option A: use existing stock item
    { "stock_item_id": 12, "quantity": 50, "purchase_price": 120 },

    // Option B: create a brand-new stock item inline
    {
      "new_item": {
        "name": "Premium Tape",
        "product_category_id": 3,
        "primary_unit_id": 1,
        "secondary_unit_id": 2,
        "secondary_per_primary": 12,
        "qty_per_primary_unit": 1,
        "qty_per_secondary_unit": 1,
        "selling_price": 250,
        "image_url": null
      },
      "quantity": 24,
      "purchase_price": 150
    }
  ]
}
```
Behavior:
- Creates transaction + items
- For each item, increases `stock_items.quantity` and sets `last_purchase_price`
- If an item includes `new_item`, a new stock item is created first (same rules as stock management), then quantity is added

Response 201 includes the created transaction and items.

#### List Purchases (filters)

GET `/api/suppliers/{supplierId}/purchases?serial=INV-2025&start_date=2025-11-01&end_date=2025-11-30&per_page=15`

#### Repeat by Serial

POST `/api/suppliers/{supplierId}/purchases/{serial}/repeat`
— Recreates the same items and updates stock. New serial is derived from the old one.

### Stock UI Integration

- From Stock Management: add a supplier dropdown and call the purchase endpoint using the chosen supplier.
- From Supplier Management: create purchase directly; the stock updates automatically.


